Edit this exact recipe photograph. All cherry tomatoes MUST be visibly cut into quartered or diced bite-size pieces with exposed cut faces, released tomato pulp and juices. Remove every whole round intact cherry tomato. Keep cooked browned large salmon flakes, tan wholewheat penne and softened diced courgette. Keep the light Cajun tomato coating. No added ingredients, herbs, garnish, cheese, sauce or side. Preserve believable single serving and generous landscape crop margins.
Exact recipe ingredients/method:
{"ingredients":[{"amount":"150g","item":"salmon fillet","allergens":["fish"]},{"amount":"75g","item":"wholewheat pasta, dry","allergens":["gluten"]},{"amount":"90g","item":"courgette"},{"amount":"90g","item":"cherry tomatoes"},{"amount":"40g","item":"Cajun tomato sauce"},{"amount":"1 tsp / 5ml","item":"olive oil"}],"method":["The listed wholewheat pasta quantity is the dry, uncooked weight. Follow the cooking and assembly steps below for this measured portion.","Bring a saucepan of water to the boil. The 75g wholewheat pasta, dry is a dry weight: cook according to its packet until tender, then drain, saving a small cup of pasta water.","Dice the courgette, cherry tomatoes into bite-size pieces. Measure the Cajun tomato sauce ready to add near the end of cooking.","Heat half the measured olive oil in a non-stick frying pan. Cook the salmon fillet separately over medium heat for about 4–5 minutes on each side, adjusting for thickness, until the centre is opaque and flakes easily. Lift onto a clean plate and break into large flakes, checking for bones. Transfer the cooked filling to a clean plate.","Add the remaining measured olive oil and courgette, cherry tomatoes to the pan. Cook over medium heat for 6–8 minutes, stirring until the courgette softens and the tomatoes release their juices.","Add the cooked pasta and filling. Stir in the measured Cajun tomato sauce and 2 tablespoons of cooking water. Heat gently for 1–2 minutes, stirring until the coating is hot. Toss gently, using another spoonful of reserved pasta water if it needs loosening. Serve immediately."]}
